ass="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">切换广告账户后，只查看当前账户的消耗、累计充值与实时余额；USD 余额 ≤ $100 时自动生成广告费充值提醒。</p></div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full font-bold"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate mr-1"></i>支持按广告账户切换费用数据</div>
