                        <div v-else class="sm:col-span-2 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50/30 p-3"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3"><div><div class="text-[10px] font-extrabold text-cyan-700">暂无广告数据</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">无需单独填写消耗，录入一次广告数据后会自动计算并同步两处。</div></div><button @click="openAdDataFromAnalytics('FB',account)" class="h-9 px-3 rounded-xl bg-cyan-600 text-white text-[11px] font-bold shrink-0"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus mr-1"></i>录入广告数据</button></div></div>
                        <div class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-emerald-100 p-3"><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">累计充值</div><div class="text-sm font-extrabold text-emerald-600 mt-1">{{ accountRechargeText(account) }}</div></div>
                        <div class="rounded-xl bg-whit